&lt;li&gt;Shape and scale Kaluza&#39;s future-state marketing function from the ground up, establishing a clear narrative &quot;north star&quot; across brand, comms, content, and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute hands-on across the full marketing lifecycle, personally crafting thought leadership and producing high-craft content without leaning heavily on external agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crafting and maintaining the company narrative and storytelling, from northstar overarching company position through to granular level materials and maintaining high grade company messaging throughout.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain complete ownership of brand equity, visual identity, and content distribution channels to ensure high message quality rather than high-volume noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and deliver an end-to-end communications, PR, and physical events strategy that builds real-world brand presence and industry authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI enablement across design, editing, and production workflows to boost output quality and speed without sacrificing authenticity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop, and mentor an agile team across comms, content, and events, embedding a shared appetite for AI-empowered execution.&lt;/li&gt;
